<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to {{appName}}!</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .container {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .title {
            color: #27ae60;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            background-color: #27ae60;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #229954;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
        }
        .features {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .feature-item {
            margin: 10px 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .feature-item:before {
            content: "✓";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: #27ae60;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">{{appName}}</div>
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="title">Welcome to Your Fitness Journey!</h2>
        
        <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
        
        <p>🎉 <strong>Congratulations!</strong> Your {{appName}} account has been successfully created and verified. We're excited to have you join our fitness community!</p>
        
        <div class="features">
            <h3>What you can do with {{appName}}:</h3>
            <div class="feature-item">Connect with certified fitness coaches</div>
            <div class="feature-item">Create and follow personalized workout plans</div>
            <div class="feature-item">Track your fitness progress</div>
            <div class="feature-item">Schedule training appointments</div>
            <div class="feature-item">Access a comprehensive exercise library</div>
            <div class="feature-item">Monitor your fitness goals and achievements</div>
        </div>
        
        <p>Ready to start your fitness transformation? Log in to your account and explore all the features we have to offer:</p>
        
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="button">Start Your Journey</a>
        </div>
        
        <p>If you have any questions or need assistance getting started, our support team is here to help. Don't hesitate to reach out!</p>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Welcome aboard!<br>The {{appName}} Team</p>
            <p><small>This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
